WEBVTT

00:00.600 --> 00:06.800
A call comes in.
The voice is urgent and official.

00:07.800 --> 00:15.600
Then a video call from a man in uniform.
He says a case is registered in her name.

00:16.800 --> 00:25.000
He tells her to stay on the call
and not to tell anyone.

00:25.600 --> 00:29.200
Her daughter: "Don't worry. It's gonna be okay.
Look, we can get help here."

00:29.600 --> 00:34.800
No real officer arrests anyone on a video call.
Hang up. Check. Call 1930.
